---
Add per-track volume and pan knobs.

Each track in the drum grid / mixer should have individual volume
and pan controls using arc knobs.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Each track displays a volume knob and a pan knob
- [ ] Volume range 0.0 to 1.0, default 0.8
- [ ] Pan range -1.0 (left) to 1.0 (right), default 0.0 (center)
- [ ] Changes reflected in audio output immediately
- [ ] Values saved/loaded with project

## Test Plan
- [ ] Adjust track volume, verify audio level changes
- [ ] Adjust track pan, verify stereo position changes
- [ ] Save project, reload, verify per-track values preserved
- [ ] Verify all 16 tracks can have independent volume/pan
